                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJSft7qFyrQjQRdyyH9Sdt3W8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tVNWVDMHpla1ZXZW1GV1RFZ3lRVTF3U2tzelQzYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "10 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "A must-stop for cyclists near Taipei Zoo!\nThis spot is a hidden treasure for bikers, perfect for a post-ride coffee break for a much-needed carb and protein refill. Whether you’ve tackled one of the challenging bike routes or just enjoyed a scenic ride, this café has exactly what you need to recharge. The location is unbeatable, right next to Taipei Zoo and surrounded by a variety of biking paths, from easy to adventurous. The shop itself is modern, stylish, and clearly designed with cyclists in mind. The owner has created a space that’s both trendy and functional.\n\nThe coffee is excellent, and their food options are thoughtfully crafted for riders, balanced with carbs and protein to help you refuel properly. They also carry a great selection of cycling accessories, including clip-in shoes, jerseys, and more. It’s also a social hub, perfect for meeting fellow riders, sharing stories, and taking a well-earned break. This is definitely a place I’ll keep coming back to.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
